# Start: anywhere. End: the same place, awake.
# After five idle minutes the first key only wakes the screensaver, so the
# first key of a walk is eaten unless a key EmulationStation ignores spends
# that press first. `wake` sends `shift` -- which the interface ignores --
# and then settles, so it costs about a second on a screen that was already
# awake and waits for the interface to come back on one that was not.
wake
